> We will come to your facility to train your personnel in Redlands, CA. Our trainers have been providing California Forklift[ instructor] training and certifying for over 15 years and have field experience in training operators of all types of Forklifts. Our training will be conducted at your facility utilizing your equipment. Training your employees "on-site" gives them the opportunity to be trained and certified on familiar equipment and allows us to customize a program specific to your companies need. Our Forklift[ Instructor] Training Course includes classroom video training with a written test, as well as a "hands-on" practical evaluation.

